  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bahamas: Promoting an Enabling Environment for Good Governance in The Bahamas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) The Bahamian criminal justice system has the capacity to investigate, utilize evidence, and prosecute cases to ensure a fair trial. 2) Key stakeholders advocate for legal and policy framework reforms to improve institutional transparency, integrity, and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Office of the Attorney General, Ministry of Legal Affairs, Office of the Department of Public Prosecutions, Office of the Public Defender, Royal Bahamas Police Force, Department of Immigration.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to increase the trust of Bahamian citizens in the criminal justice system in The Bahamas.</narrative>
  </description>
